    "note": "Single source for the web build: tokens/build.mjs writes src/styles/tokens.css. Sizes are CSS px. Colours are OKLCH. Tier values are the percentage of the foreground colour mixed into transparent. Values come from the installed-app steal list (Claude Desktop, Grok Bot, Linear, Discord, Spotify), proven in 1 build."
